routing table
its just a set of rules that every device use to anser one question:
    where do i send the data?


routing table is the GPS of the data

this is how roughly it works:

1- to reach the store, take the main street
    to get to 196.168.1.5
    go out eth0

2- to go anywhere, take the highway
    to reach anywhere else
    go out default


the columns of structure:

1- destination
the target network: 196.168.1.2

2- gatway:
the next-hop router: 196.1.1.5

3- the interface:
which network card to use: eth0

4- metric:
cost (lower = prefered) 100

